{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36704","headline":"秋日汴河客舍酬友人 · 罗隐","name":"秋日汴河客舍酬友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁宋追游早岁同，偶然违别事皆空。\n年如流水催何急，道似危途动即穷。\n醉舞且欣连夜月，狂吟还聚上楼风。\n烦君更枉骚人句，白凤灵虵满袖中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}